    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d64">

                <pb facs="0172" n="76" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg76"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Sherman to the
                            Governor of Pennsylvania</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-01-19"><hi rendition="#italic">January 19,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Please advise me when the trial of Sheriff Martin and his deputies will take
                    place. With the President’s approval it is desired to have a representative of
                    the Department of Justice attend the trial, but not to take part therein, in
                    view of the international questions which may result.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sherman.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
